<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Horse Racing-Punchestown racemeeting re-scheduled.</title>
<headline>Horse Racing-Punchestown racemeeting re-scheduled.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The new date for Tuesday's postponed racemeeting at Punchestown, County Kildare, is January 10, the Irish Turf Club said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Turf Club said in a statement that fresh declarations for Friday's re-scheduled meeting must be made by 1000 GMT on Thursday, January 9. --Dublin newsroom 353-1-660-3377.</p>
</text>
